# Line endings. Without this, a Windows clone gets CRLF in these files:
# bash cannot parse the shell scripts (npm run verify fails), and the backend
# tests that read workflow YAML and match it against patterns containing \n fail.
# Found by the independent runbook walkthrough, 16 Nov 2026 (issue #282).
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
